out 70 ms); a new turn on a live walk reruns 3 components; Context's model renders through it are linear in turns (64M ticks a request at 160 turns, 0.36M a new pair). Also Web's: the renders for unmerged entries and hold reasons (stage 5) and the user agent's walk (stage 4).

